<div class="about-body">
  <h1 class="about-head">about</h1>
  <p>
    october tooth is zachary carter threlkeld. this space is where most things live. new music, cassette tapes,
    arrangement ideas, shows, paintings, designs, song starts, and so on. cassette tapes recorded on my 
    tascam 424 mkiii.
  </p>
  <p>
    there's no fixed schedule. roughly a tape every few weeks, sometimes
    faster, sometimes not.
    this is the squeeze part, not the juice part. bunch o' goods. thanks for stopping by,
    love ya, talk to ya soon.
  </p>
  <p>
    alongside the tapes: paintings, photos, playlists, and whatever else
    seems fun to share. shows and releases get announced here
    too. bunch o' good stuff.
  </p>
</div>

